        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Kiss Kiss (Bang Bang), Iron Man, Iron Man 2, The Avengers, Iron Man 3\n- People: Paul Bettany, Stellan Skarsgård, Chris Penn\n- Characters: J.A.R.V.I.S., Vision\n- Franchises: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n\nFacts:\n- The film \"Kiss Kiss (Bang Bang)\" features Stellan Skarsgård, Chris Penn, and Paul Bettany.\n- Paul Bettany is known for voicing J.A.R.V.I.S. and portraying Vision in the Marvel Cinematic Universe.\n- Paul Bettany appeared in the Marvel Cinematic Universe films \"Iron Man\" (2008), \"Iron Man 2\" (2010), \"The Avengers\" (2012), and \"Iron Man 3\" (2013).\n- Paul Bettany garnered praise for his Marvel Cinematic Universe roles in films released in 2015 and 2016.",
